<title>SINGAPORE: SOCCER-TIGER CUP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TIGER CUP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Tiger Cup group B</p>
<p>matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>    Brunei	 1	  Philippines	0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer - Irwan Mohammed (28th minute) </p>
<p>Attendance: 3,000</p>
<p>    Thailand     1	  Malaysia	   1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Thailand - Kiatasuk Senamuang (28th)</p>
<p>Malaysia - Zainal Abidin Hassan (57th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 14,000</p>
<p>Group B standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>points):</p>
<p> Thailand	  3 2 1 0 7</p>
<p> Singapore	 3 2 1 0 7</p>
<p> Malaysia	  3 1 2 0 5</p>
<p> Brunei	    3 1 0 2 3</p>
<p> Philippines     4 0 0 4 0</p>
<p>Top two qualify for semifinals.</p>
</text>
